   {
    "primary": {
     "type": "TextChapter",
     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "The Aalto design system strives to be technology agnostic, ensuring that its components and assets are available across multiple technologies. As the design system continues to evolve, additional language implementations will be incorporated. ",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Currently, the following packages are available:\n- @aalto-dx/tokens: Design tokens in CSS and JSON formats, and a custom CSS reset\n- @aalto-dx/react-components: User interface elements (Components, Modules and Sections) for React projects\n- @aalto-dx/component-styles: CSS styling for the UI elements used in non-React projects\n- @aalto-dx/react-starter: Quick-start template project(s) exemplifying DS usage in a React channel",
       "spans": [
        {
         "start": 51,
         "end": 67,
         "type": "strong"
        },
        {
         "start": 133,
         "end": 159,
         "type": "strong"
        },
        {
         "start": 224,
         "end": 229,
         "type": "hyperlink",
         "data": {
          "link_type": "Web",
          "url": "https://react.dev/",
          "target": "_blank"
         }
        },
        {
         "start": 241,
         "end": 267,
         "type": "strong"
        },
        {
         "start": 330,
         "end": 353,
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "To start using any Aalto libraries in your project, you will need access to the Aalto Git package registry. The libraries are distributed as npm packages, so you must have npm installed. We recommend configuring registry access by using a .npmrc file. Additionally, ensure that your project is using compatible versions of node, npm, and relevant libraries such as React.",
       "spans": [
        {
         "start": 239,
         "end": 245,
         "type": "em"
        }
       ],
       "direction": "ltr"
      }
     ],
