      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "In addition to the npm packages, developers can explore the implemented libraries through Storybook sites. Storybook provides a dedicated environment for showcasing UI elements in various states, allowing developers to effectively view their props, explore different variations, and interact with them to observe their behavior in different scenarios.",
       "spans": [
